# API Changes — DonateNow v2.0

> Version: 2.0 — Multi-Cause Donation Platform
> Previous: [v1.0 PRD Data Layer](../../v1.0/PRD.md)
> Reference: [PRD.mdc](../Context/PRD.mdc) | [Database_Changes.mdc](./Database_Changes.mdc)

---

## 1. API Evolution Overview

### v1.0 Edge Functions (Preserved)

| Function | Purpose | Status in v2.0 |
|---|---|---|
| `create-order` | Create Razorpay order for one-time payment | ✅ Preserved (enhanced) |
| `verify-payment` | Verify Razorpay signature + insert donation | ✅ Modified (triggers receipt) |
| `razorpay-webhook` | Handle payment status events | ✅ Preserved |

### v2.0 New Edge Functions

| Function | Purpose | Priority |
|---|---|---|
| `create-subscription` | Create Razorpay monthly subscription | P0 |
| `cancel-subscription` | Cancel active subscription | P0 |
| `subscription-webhook` | Handle recurring payment events | P0 |
| `generate-receipt` | Generate 80G tax receipt PDF | P0 |
| `generate-impact-report` | Generate AI-powered impact report | P1 |

