## 2. Campaign APIs (Supabase SDK — Direct)

### 2.1 List Verified Campaigns (Marketplace)

```swift
// Client SDK — no Edge Function needed
let campaigns = try await supabase
    .from("donation_profiles")
    .select("*, users!creator_id(name)")
    .eq("verification_status", "verified")
    .eq("is_active", true)
    .order("created_at", ascending: false)
    .execute()
    .value
```

**Auth**: Anonymous (RLS allows public read of verified campaigns)
**Response**: Array of `DonationProfile` with creator name

### 2.2 Search Campaigns

```swift
let results = try await supabase
    .from("donation_profiles")
    .select()
    .eq("verification_status", "verified")
    .eq("is_active", true)
    .ilike("title", "%\(query)%")
    .execute()
    .value
```

**Auth**: Anonymous
**Filters**: `category`, `title` (ilike), `target_amount` range

### 2.3 Get Campaign Detail

```swift
let campaign = try await supabase
    .from("donation_profiles")
    .select("*, users!creator_id(name, avatar_url)")
    .eq("id", campaignId)
    .single()
    .execute()
    .value
```

**Auth**: Anonymous (verified campaigns only via RLS)

### 2.4 Create Campaign

```swift
let newCampaign = try await supabase
    .from("donation_profiles")
    .insert(CreateCampaignRequest(
        creator_id: userId,
        title: title,
        description: description,
        category: category,
        target_amount: targetAmount,
        image_url: imageUrl
    ))
    .select()
    .single()
    .execute()
    .value
```

**Auth**: Authenticated (Creator)
**Validation**: Title required, description required, target_amount > 0

### 2.5 Update Campaign

```swift
try await supabase
    .from("donation_profiles")
    .update(UpdateCampaignRequest(
        title: newTitle,
        description: newDescription,
        target_amount: newTarget
    ))
    .eq("id", campaignId)
    .execute()
```

**Auth**: Authenticated (Creator — own campaigns only via RLS)
**Note**: Material changes reset verification_status to 'pending'

