## 3. Donation APIs (Enhanced)

### 3.1 Create Order (v1.0 Enhanced)

**Edge Function**: `create-order`

```json
// Request
{
  "amount": 500,
  "currency": "INR",
  "campaign_id": "uuid-of-campaign"
}

// Response — Success (200)
{
  "order_id": "order_xxxxxxxxx",
  "amount": 50000,
  "currency": "INR",
  "key_id": "rzp_test_xxxxxxxxx"
}

// Response — Error (400)
{ "error": "Invalid donation amount." }

// Response — Error (400)
{ "error": "Campaign is not active or not verified." }
```

**Changes from v1.0**: Added `campaign_id` parameter; validates campaign is verified and active.

### 3.2 Verify Payment (v1.0 Enhanced)

**Edge Function**: `verify-payment`

```json
// Request
{
  "razorpay_order_id": "order_xxxxxxxxx",
  "razorpay_payment_id": "pay_xxxxxxxxx",
  "razorpay_signature": "xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx",
  "donor_name": "Rahul Sharma",
  "donor_email": "rahul@example.com",
  "donor_phone": "9876543210",
  "amount": 500,
  "campaign_id": "uuid-of-campaign",
  "donor_user_id": "uuid-of-user-or-null",
  "is_anonymous": false
}

// Response — Success (200)
{
  "success": true,
  "donation_id": "uuid-of-donation",
  "receipt_id": "uuid-of-receipt",
  "receipt_url": "https://storage.supabase.co/receipts/DN-2026-00001.pdf"
}

// Response — Error (400)
{ "error": "Payment verification failed." }
```

**Changes from v1.0**: Added `campaign_id`, `donor_user_id`, `is_anonymous`; triggers receipt generation; returns receipt info.

### 3.3 Get Donor Wall

```swift
let donors = try await supabase
    .from("donations")
    .select("donor_name, amount, created_at")
    .eq("campaign_id", campaignId)
    .eq("status", "completed")
    .eq("is_anonymous", false)
    .order("created_at", ascending: false)
    .limit(50)
    .execute()
    .value
```

**Auth**: Anonymous (RLS allows public read of non-anonymous completed donations)

### 3.4 Get Donation History (Registered Donor)

```swift
let history = try await supabase
    .from("donations")
    .select("*, donation_profiles!campaign_id(title), tax_receipts!receipt_id(receipt_number, pdf_url)")
    .eq("donor_user_id", userId)
    .order("created_at", ascending: false)
    .execute()
    .value
```

**Auth**: Authenticated (Donor — own donations via RLS)

