## 4. Receipt APIs

### 4.1 Generate Receipt

**Edge Function**: `generate-receipt`
**Trigger**: Called internally by `verify-payment` after successful donation.

```json
// Request (Internal)
{
  "donation_id": "uuid",
  "donor_name": "Rahul Sharma",
  "donor_email": "rahul@example.com",
  "amount": 500,
  "donation_date": "2026-06-12",
  "campaign_title": "Education for Children",
  "ngo_name": "Example Foundation",
  "ngo_80g_number": "80G/12345/2025",
  "ngo_pan": "AAACE1234F",
  "ngo_address": "123 NGO Street, Mumbai"
}

// Response — Success (200)
{
  "receipt_id": "uuid",
  "receipt_number": "DN-2026-00001",
  "pdf_url": "https://xyz.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/receipts/DN-2026-00001.pdf",
  "financial_year": "FY2025-26"
}

// Response — Error (500)
{ "error": "Receipt generation failed. Queued for retry." }
```

### 4.2 Get Receipts (Donor)

```swift
let receipts = try await supabase
    .from("tax_receipts")
    .select("*, donations!donation_id(amount, campaign_id, donation_profiles!campaign_id(title))")
    .order("created_at", ascending: false)
    .execute()
    .value
```

**Auth**: Authenticated (Donor — own receipts via RLS)

### 4.3 Download Receipt PDF

```swift
let data = try await supabase.storage
    .from("receipts")
    .download(path: receiptFilePath)
```

**Auth**: Authenticated (Donor — own receipts)

