## 6. Verification APIs

### 6.1 Submit Verification Request

```swift
let request = try await supabase
    .from("verification_requests")
    .insert(VerificationSubmission(
        campaign_id: campaignId,
        documents_url: documentUrls,
        status: "pending"
    ))
    .select()
    .single()
    .execute()
    .value

// Also update campaign status
try await supabase
    .from("donation_profiles")
    .update(["verification_status": "pending"])
    .eq("id", campaignId)
    .execute()
```

**Auth**: Authenticated (Creator)

### 6.2 Get Verification Queue (Admin)

```swift
let queue = try await supabase
    .from("verification_requests")
    .select("*, donation_profiles!campaign_id(title, creator_id, users!creator_id(name, email))")
    .eq("status", "pending")
    .order("submitted_at", ascending: true)
    .execute()
    .value
```

**Auth**: Authenticated (Admin only via RLS)

### 6.3 Approve Campaign

```swift
// Update verification request
try await supabase
    .from("verification_requests")
    .update([
        "status": "approved",
        "reviewer_id": adminUserId,
        "reviewed_at": Date().ISO8601Format()
    ])
    .eq("id", requestId)
    .execute()

// Update campaign status
try await supabase
    .from("donation_profiles")
    .update(["verification_status": "verified"])
    .eq("id", campaignId)
    .execute()
```

**Auth**: Authenticated (Admin only via RLS)

### 6.4 Reject Campaign

```swift
try await supabase
    .from("verification_requests")
    .update([
        "status": "rejected",
        "reviewer_id": adminUserId,
        "review_notes": rejectionReason,
        "reviewed_at": Date().ISO8601Format()
    ])
    .eq("id", requestId)
    .execute()

try await supabase
    .from("donation_profiles")
    .update(["verification_status": "rejected"])
    .eq("id", campaignId)
    .execute()
```

**Auth**: Authenticated (Admin only via RLS)

